<title>UK: B.A.T Industries nine mths profits up 9 pct.</title>
<headline>B.A.T Industries nine mths profits up 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		39.9		   vs 36.5</p>
<p> Pretax nine months     2,039		  vs 1,867</p>
<p> Pretax third quarter   714		    vs 680</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on third quarter pre-tax profits for tobacco to financial services giant B.A.T Industries Plc were in a range of 650 to 725 million stg.  </p>
<p> Revenue nine mnths     18,232		 vs 17,250</p>
<p> Revenue third qtr	6,311		  vs 5,926</p>
<p> Operating nine mnths   2,087		  vs 2,044</p>
<p> Operating third qtr    753		    vs 748</p>
<p> Interest nine mnths    146		    vs 177</p>
<p> Interest third qtr     51		     vs 68</p>
<p> Tax nine mnths	   702		    vs 662</p>
<p> Tax third qtr	    249		    vs 241</p>
<p> Net taxed nine mnths   1,337		  vs 1,205</p>
<p> Net taxed third qtr    465		    vs 439</p>
